    },
    {
      "text": "Although small, its venomous barbs render this POKéMON dangerous. The female has smaller horns.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "A mild-mannered POKéMON that does not like to fight. Beware, its small horns secrete venom.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "The poison hidden in its small horn is extremely po tent. Even a tiny scratch can have fatal results.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Although not very combative, it will torment its foes with poison spikes if it is threatened in any way.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "Small and very docile, it protects itself with its small, poisonous horn when attacked.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
